<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id">Joel</book>
  <para style="h">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joel</para>
  <para style="mt">Joel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pethuel’ tapa Joel tungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No upate aw, tami ngai unlen, gam sunga tengte zosie in zong na bil uh daw un! Noma le na pu na pate khangin tam bang thu a pieng ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam thu na tate hil unlen, na tate un amau’ tate hilsawn hinlen, a khang a khangin kihil sawn uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pettan kauphete’ nehmawh teng, kauphe honte in netum a, kauphe honte’ nehmawh teng, a kitom kauphete in ne-in, a kitom kauphe’ nehmawh teng, a susie kauphe in a netum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No zukhamte aw, tho unlen kap un; no lenggazu dawn zosiete aw, thumin tau un, azieh pen na kam sung panun zutuite kikhahtan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen a thahat, a kisim zo lo minam a tampi khat in ka gam ang sim hi; amau’ ha pen humpi’ ha tawh kibang a, humpi nute’ ha bangin hiem mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lengguite ei suhsiet pieh vua, ka theikungte zong a sattan uhi; a hawte hawh dawhin a paimang vua, a bate zong khu a kangdang sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />La-ip puon silin a sen lawmpa a kaa nungah nu bangin kap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ biehinn panin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehna om nawn lo hi. Topa’ nasem ahi siempute thumin a tau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lozaute a kisie sieng ta a, leitangte a kap vangut ta hi; azieh pen ankungte kisusie a, lenggazute gawkangin sathaute tawp sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No lohlote aw, da un. No lenggui cingte aw, mangbu le mangbuhamte adingin thumin kap un; bangzieh ahei cile lolai ante kisie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengguite gawpmang sieng a, theikungte tuolah kunsuh ta hi. Mang kawlsingte, lutu kungte le apple kungte a kipan, lolai-a singkung zosie gawta sieng zo hi; a tahtahin ci leih mite lahah lungnopna kici om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No siempute aw, la-ip puon silin kap un; no maitam nasemte aw, thum unlen tau un. No ka Pasien’ nasemte aw, hing pei unlen zan khuovahin la-ip puon silin kap un! Topa’ inn panin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate kipie nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A siengtho antanna khat bawl unlen, kikhopna thupi khat hlan un. Na Topa Pasien uh’ biehinn sungah upate le gam sunga tengte zosie, kaikhawm unlen Topa kungah kiko-in thungen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kadeisei, tuami ni khu! Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ ni ang nai ta a, Vanglienpa kung pana ang pei sietna bangin ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eima’ mitmu-in an neh ding le i Pasien’ biehinn sung panin kipahna le thanopnate kilamang ta hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leikhal nei-ah khaicite gaw sieng a, an kholna innte hawmsuoh ta hi; bu a tun lo ziehin ansalte zong kisie gawp ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ganhingte cimaw-in tautau uhi! bawng honte a vahthap uhi, bangzieh ahei cile amate adingin lohing om lo hi; tuuhonte nangawn zong cimaw-in a lungdong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma kungah kang kiko hi. Bangzieh ahei cile gamlah lohing zosie mei in hulvam ta a, meikuong in lolai-a singkung zosie a katum sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamlah lohingte mei in a kahtum sieng ziehin, luidungte kanggaw sieng ta a, gamsate nangawn zong nangma kungah ang kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion ah pengkul mut unlen, ka muol siengtho tungah patauna aw gingsah un! Topa’ ni tung ta ahi ziehin gam sunga tengte zosie zau-in citun sieng uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuomiel ni le lungzin ni, meiikai ni le khuozin ni nai mama ta hi! Muoltung tengah meivom a kai bangin, a thahat le a tam mama galkapte ang kuon uhi; tangtawng panin tua bangte a om ngai nai sih a, a khangkhangin zong tuate a om ngai ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate mai-ah mei in hulvam a, a nua lam vuah meikuong kileh vapual hi. Amate masanga gam pen Eden um tawh kibang a, ahi vangin a nua lama gam pen senel gam gawta hi a, bangma in amate a suohta sah thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A melpuoh uh sakol tawh kibang a, gal-sakolte bangin a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sakol leeng ging bangin amate muol tung tengah a kopdien vua, mei in a kahtum butu ging le gal sim dinga a kithawi, a thahat mama galkap honte tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate mai-ah mite lungkhamin, maitang zosie a kangdang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Galhangte bangin gal a sim vua, galkapte bangin kul tungah a ka uhi. A lampi ciet uh a zui vua, a lampi panun a piel sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat kiphukha loin, a lampi son ciet uh a zui uhi; amate in galhiemte a phugawp vua, khawl vawt loin ma a nawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuopi sungah a kopdien vua, kul tung tengah a tai kawikawi uhi; inn sung tengah a kato vua, guta bangin tawlette panin a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mai vuah leitung kilawhin vante kiling gawp hi. Ni le hlate zong miel a, aasite tang nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A galkapte mai-ah Topa in thu a gen hi; a galkap honte nah tam sam e! Ama’ thupieh a mang mite simzawh ding hi lo hi. A tahtahin Topa’ ni pen thupi mama hi; zong zau huoi mama hi, koi in thuohzo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hizongle tu nangawnin zong lungsim tahtah tawh kisia-in antanna, kaana le mauna tawh ka kungah hing kinualekia un, Topa in ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na puonsilte uh botkeh zaw loin, na lungtangte uh botkeh zaw un. Topa na Pasien uh kungah hing kinualekia un, azieh pen ama migi-in mi hepi a, lungduoi-in itna kip tawh kidimin mi dan a pie nuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in Topa na Pasien vua dingin an tawh biehna le dawn thei biehnate na pieh thei nadingun, ama ang kihei-in a lungsim hing khiem a, a thupha ang nuasiepieh ding le ang nuasiepieh lo ding koi in thei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion ah pengkul mut un; a siengtho antanna khat bawl un; kikhopna thupi khat hlan un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />mihonpi kaikhawm un. mihonte siensuo un; khanghamte kaikhawm un; khanghamte le naupangte, nawi ne lai nausente nangawn kaikhawm un. Zinei pa in a lupna nuasie hinlen, monu in a lupna dalna nuasie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Maitam le talaap kikalah Topa’ nasem siempute kap uheh. Amate in, “ Topa aw, na mite suohta sah inlen, nangma’ gouluote, minamte lahah simmaw le thu gentena-in ei kineisah poma sin. Bang dingin mite lahah, ‘A Pasien uh hei-a om ahei?’ ei kici ding ahei, cisah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ama’ leitang hing lainatin, ama’ mite ang khuotuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in a mite dawngkia a: An, zu, le sathau kang pie ding hi, tua hile na lungkim ding uhi; keima in note pen minamte lahah mi simmaw-in kang koi nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na kung panun gamlapi- ah sahlam galkapte hemkhie-in, senel gamgaw munah amate ka notmang ding a, a masate nisuona tuipi sungah, a nukhiate nitumna tuipi sungah ka notmang ding hi; a gimnam le a ui a than uh kikhawto ding hi. Ama in na golpite a bawl tahtah zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leisiet aw, zau sin; lungdamin kipah in, azieh pen Topa in na lienpite sem zo ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gamlah gamsate aw, zau sih un, azieh pen gam sunga lopate dawng zo hi; singkungte ga-in lengguite le theikung tampitah a ga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zion tate aw, lungdam unlen, Topa na Pasien uh sungah kipah un; azieh pen ama in na dihna uh a kilah nadingin guo masa zusah zo a, note adingin guotui tampitah ang buohsuh zo ta hi. Guo masa le guo nukhia zong nidang lai bangin a zusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ancilna phuol an tawh kidim ding a, lenggazu le sathau zong umlebeel a dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note sim dinga kang sawl kauphe honpi, a kitom, a susie, le a petsan kauphete ahi, ka galkap honte in ang nehpieh kum sunga a piengte, kang lokia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note in tampi ne-in na lung uh kim ding a, lamdang taha ang bawlpieh na Topa Pasien uh’ min na phat ding uhi. Tuale ka mite in maizumna a thuohkia ngai ta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel laikimah ka op lam le kei, na Topa Pasien uh ka hi a, kei simlo koima dang a op lo lam note in nei thei ding uhi. Tuaci’n ka mite ahile kimaizumsah ngai nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin mi zosie tungah ka hlagau ka buo ding hi; na tapate ule na tanute un thu a hil ding vua, na khanghamte un mangte manin, na khangnote un mang a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin sila numeite le sila pasalte tung nangawnah ka hlagau ka buo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima in leitung le vante ah hilkholna limte ahi sisan le meikhu lompi ka lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thupi le a zauhuoi Topa’ ni a tun masangin ni khuomiel suohin hla sisan a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ min tawh a kiko poma in hutdamna nga ding hi; azieh pen Topa in a gensa bangin Zion Muol le Jerusalem khuo sungah a suohta lai mi a om ding hi. Topa in a hlat mite a suohta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum ni le khum hun ciengin Judah le Jerusalem, a nidang hun ka bahsah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />keima in minam zosie kaikhawmin Jehoshaphat kuomah ka peipisuh ding a, khum munah ka mite le ka gouluo Israel ziehin amate tungah thu ka khen ding hi, azieh pen amate in minamte lahah Israel a kithezah sah uhi. Amate in ka gam a hawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka mite adingin aisanin a pahtat numeite lei nadingin naupangte, zu lei nadingin nungahte a zua vua, tuale a khamtahun zu a dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tyre, Sidon, le Philistia gam zosie aw, keima tungah bang bawl sawm na hi uh ahei? Bang khat po zieha ei thuh sawm na hi uh amah? Note in ei thuhkia na hi uleh, ke’n zong na luzang vuah na na sepsate uh kinawtah le gangtahin kang tusahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in ka ngun le ka kham teng nei lahpieh ta vua, na biehinnpi vuah ka gougil teng na puo sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note in Judah mite, Jerusalem mite, le Greek mite tungah na zua vua, a gamgi panun a gamlapi-ah na hemmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in na zuana uh mun ciet panin amate ka hantawh ding a, na luzang vuah na sepsa teng uh ka tungsahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in Judah mite khut sungah na tanute ule na tapate uh ka zua ding a, amate in a gamlapi-a om gam khat ahi Sebea-te tungah zuasawn ding uhi; bang ding ahei cile Topa in a gensa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minamte tungah tam thu phuongzah un: Galdo dingin kithawi unlen, galhangte hantawh un. Galkapte zosie in naisah unlen, amate hing kuonsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lokaina na tute uh namsau-in kheng unlen, singba heuhna na namkawite uh teipi-in kheng un; a zawngkhal pa in zong, Kei galhang ka hi hi,” ci taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No a kimvela om minam zosie aw, mallangin hing pei unlen, khum munnah hing kikhawm un. Topa aw, na galhangte hing peipisuh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minamte, amau le amau hing kihantawh uh hinlen, Jehoshaphat kuomah hing peito ta uheh; bangzieh ahei cile na kimvel vua om minam zosie thu khen dingin khum munah keima ka to ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An lah hun ta ahi ziehin na phieukawi uh tawi un. Lengga cilna kuong dimin, lenggatui dawna zong dimlet ta ahi ziehin, hing pei unlen hing cil un, bangzieh ahei cile a gitlona uh lien mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thukhenna kuom sungah mihon tampitah a om hi! Azieh pen thukenna kuom sungah Topa a nai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nipi le hlapi miel zo a, aasite tang nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zion panin Topa hawhin, Jerusalem panin awng vapuoh a, vanpi le leipi a kilawh hi. Hinanle mite adingin Topa pen kibuhna hi a, Israel mite adingin mun muonhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n note in keima, ka muol siengtho Zion-a teng Topa na Pasien uh ka hi lam na thei ta ding uhi. Jerusalem siengtho ding a, minamte in ama sungah lam a hla ngai nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin muolsangte panin zuningte ang taasuh ding a, muoltangte ah bawngnawite luongin, Judah gam luidung zosie ah tui luong ding hi; Topa’ inn panin tuisam khat pul ding a, tua in Shittim kuom teng a nomsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah mite tungah a tatsiet zieh ule, a gam sung vuah maw nei lote’ sisan a luonsah ziehun, Egypt gam, ten lona gam suohin Edom gam, senel gam a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Judah gam pen kumtawn tenna-in kinei ding a, Jerusalem pen a khangkhangin tenna-in kinei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in amau’ sisan phu la-in, a khielnate uh ka maisah sih ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile Zion ah Topa a teng hi.
  </para>
</usx>
